      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <h3>Re-Documentation process and tool</h3>
<p>Another software process and tool to consider with documentation for software is <strong>Re-Documentation</strong>.  Many legacy systems lack documentation which makes maintenance difficult as software engineers would need to study and understand the system repeatedly.  One solution is to re-document the legacy system using tools to automate the process. Click on the owl which will take you to a website which discusses this process and tool.</p>

